@startuml
title Deterministic lookahead delivery

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}

rectangle "HotStoreState leaf" as Store #FEE2E2
rectangle "Producer canonicalization\nreify and resting_on sort\nstore-owned collections by content" as Canon #FEF3C7
rectangle "Complete process path\ncanonical Par member" as Member #DBEAFE

rectangle "success\nPathMap<()>" as Success #DCFCE7
rectangle "truncated\nPathMap<()>" as Truncated #EDE9FE
rectangle "failure\nPathMap<()>" as Failure #FCE7F3

rectangle "EPM1 field 9\ncanonical set-trie bytes" as Epm #D1FAE5
rectangle "scheduler-width invariant\npost-state-visible result" as Gate #CFFAFE

Store --> Canon
Canon --> Member
Member --> Success : quiescent
Member --> Truncated : depth cut
Member --> Failure : refusal
Success --> Epm
Truncated --> Epm
Failure --> Epm
Epm --> Gate

note bottom of Member #F9FAFB
  Canonicalizing each member and
  canonicalizing the unordered member
  set are distinct obligations.
end note
@enduml
